==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>, delay 2~6 seconds<sup>60f~180f</sup>.
*1 [[Shy Boy]] spawns after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Shy Boy]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Teacher Bear]]s spawn, delay 6~14 seconds<sup>180f~420f</sup>.
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.
**Infinite [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Mooth]]s spawn, delay 6~14 seconds<sup>180f~420f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns.

==Strategy==
As [[Shy Boy]] spawns immediately, you should immediately slow his progress with [[Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Cat]] and [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Wall Cat]] and work on it from there. Try to keep some units ready if possible and save your [[Cat Cannon]] for the [[Assassin Bear]]. The moment you see Assassin Bear, don't hesitate the use the Cat Cannon, otherwise it'll wipe out all of your cats very quickly before you even realize it.

